-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/925413-w-tf-actual-play-the-eater-of-names?p=943724#post943724\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I generally like this game, and look forward to more being posted. The only problem is that Min's player's voice annoys me. But that's relatively minor.</div> </div> </div> </div>Production will get right on that. Quick question, would you rather she take up smoking or that we have a surrogate speak for the character?<br /> <br /> I am enjoying the game. Though I wish this one had a wiki like the other game where I could see more details on the characters. And also so that I can eventually see stats on The Eater of Names if/when he shows up. Though, chances are that will Chris will post it anyway (right Chris??) so I guess I'm not too worried.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":5279,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5279-amravanti","user":"Amravanti","date":". 08-04-2016, 06:02 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5279-amravanti","name":"Amravanti","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5279_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"465"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-04T17:35:39-07:00","id":944021,"title":"","content":"The sixth episode is now up! Min has to show some humility, a training session is interrupted by a bid for power, and the pack seek the wisdom of the Wen.<br /> \u200b<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://shoutengine.com/InSanityWeTrustProductions/werewolf-the-forsaken-actual-play-the-eater-of-22250\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/