nk":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7354-monsieurcutts","name":"MonsieurCutts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7354_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"19"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-21T13:57:41-08:00","id":1020626,"title":"","content":"Here is Luck Rat's Character Sheet (from memory but should be fairly accurate).<br /> <br /> <b>Lucky Rat, \u201cJames\u201d Song Li</b><br /> <br /> <b>Concept:</b> The Exterminator<br /> <br /> <b>Blood</b>: Destroyer<br /> <b>Bone: </b>Philosopher<br /> <br /> <b>Auspice</b>: Rahu<br /> <b>Tribe</b>: Hunters in Darkness<br /> <br /> <b>Attributes</b>:<br /> Intelligence 2, Wits 3, Resolve 2<br /> Strength 3, Dexterity 3, Stamina 3<br /> Presence 2, Manipulation 2, Composure 2<br /> <br /> <b>Skills</b>:<br /> Academics 1, Investigation 3, Medicine 1, Occult 2 (Beshilu)<br /> Athletics 4, Brawl 4 (Bite), Stealth 3, Survival 1, Weaponry 1<br /> Empathy 1, Intimidation 1, Persuasion 1, Streetwise 2<br /> <br /> <b>Merits</b>:<br /> Contacts 1 (Exterminators), Trained Observer 3, Dedicated Locus 2, Residential Area 2, Resources 1, Totem 2, First Tongue, Language (English)<br /> <br /> <b>Primal Urge</b>: 2<br /> <b>Willpower</b>: 4<br /> <b>Harmony</b>: 6<br /> <b>Renown</b>: Cunning 1, Glory 1, Purity 2<br /> <br /> <b>Gifts</b>: Full Moon (Killer Instinct, Warrior's Hide), Stealth (Shadow Pelt), Strength (Predator's Unmatched Pursuit, Primal Strength), City (City Eyes), Hunting (Honed Senses)<br /> <br /> <b>Rites</b>: Sacred Hunt, Shadow Call<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2354,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2354-mremann","user":"mremann","date":". 12-21-2016, 05:00 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2354-mremann","name":"mremann","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-23T10:31:50-08:00","id":1021326,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MonsieurCutts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/925413-w-tf-actual-play-the-eater-of-names?p=1020376#post1020376\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is there any chance the Character Sheets for the Pack will be posted up anywhere? I'd be really curious to see them assuming there players consented of course.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bI'll ask the rest of the group if they're happy to have their character sheets posted up; if so, sure.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>- Chris Allen, Aberrant Line Developer, Freelance Writer<br /> <br /> \u200bLike my work? Feel like helping me stay supplied with tea? Check out my <b><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/acrozatarim\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1757-acrozatarim","name":"Acrozatarim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-11T13:30:24-08:00","id":1030220,"title":"","content":"We're trying to figure this out and you're the only authority I know that would really run this.<br /> <br /> The Blast Numina.<br /> <br /> 'The spirit may wound opponents at a distance. Range is equal to 10 yards per dot of Power and the spirit does not suffer range penalties. If the activation roll succeeds, the Blast wounds as a +0L firearm. The spirit may increase the lethality of its Blast by paying Essence \u2014 every two Essence spent increases the \u201cweapon\u201d by +1L. The maximum weapon bonus is equal to the spirit\u2019s Rank.'<br /> <br /> We're discussing this in another thread and trying to decide if this power allows for the 'Defense vs Firearms' powers some people have. Some say that, because it doesn't say so, there is no way to avoid it beyond not being in range. But we're thinking because of 'the Blast wounds as a +0L firearm.' and how its damage bonus is called weapon bonus, it's treated similarly to a firearm.<br /> <br /> Also, if it is indefensible, what rating fetish do you think would be appropriate to use a Numina?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 01-11-2017, 04:54 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-29T11:22:19-08:00","id":1040104,"title":"","content":"Finally caught up on a whole slew of session uploads! Here are sessions 15 to 19, as the pack return to Hong Kong in the Three Harmonies story!<br /> <br /> \u200bUnfortunately, session 15 cut off only an hour into the recording for reasons we aren't entirely sure of <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Session 15: <a href=\"http://shoutengine.com/InSanityWeTrustProductions/werewolf-the-forsaken-actual-play-the-eater-of-nam-30527\" target=\"_blank\">http://shoutengine.com/InSanityWeTru...r-of-nam-30527</a><br /> <br /> \u200bSession 16: <a href=\"http://shoutengine.com/InSanityWeTrustProductions/werewolf-the-forsaken-actual-play-the-eater-of-30530\" target=\"_blank\">http://shoutengine.com/InSanityWeTru...eater-of-30530</a><br /> <br /> Session 17: <a href=\"http://shoutengine.com/InSanityWeTrustProductions/werewolf-the-forsaken-actual-play-the-eater-of-30531\" target=\"_blank\">http://shoutengine.com/InSanityWeTru...eater-of-30531</a><br /> <br /> Session 18: <a href=\"http://shoutengine.com/InSanityWeTrustProductions/werewolf-the-forsaken-actual-play-the-eater-of-30554\" target=\"_blank\">http://shoutengine.com/InSanityWeTru...eater-of-30554</a><br /> <br /> \u200bSession 19: <a href=\"http://shoutengine.com/InSanityWeTrustProductions/werewolf-the-forsaken-actual-play-the-eater-of-30558\" target=\"_blank\">http://shoutengine.com/InSanityWeTru...eater-of-30558</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>- Chris Allen, Aberrant Line Developer, Freelance Writer<br /> <br /> \u200bLike my work? Feel like helping me stay supplied with tea? Check out my <b><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/acrozatarim\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1757-acrozatarim","name":"Acrozatarim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-29T11:33:59-08:00","id":1040115,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/925413-w-tf-actual-play-the-eater-of-names?p=1030220#post1030220\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">We're trying to figure this out and you're the only authority I know that would really run this.<br /> <br /> The Blast Numina.<br /> <br /> 'The spirit may wound opponents at a distance. Range is equal to 10 yards per dot of Power and the spirit does not suffer range penalties. If the activation roll succeeds, the Blast wounds as a +0L firearm. The spirit may increase the lethality of its Blast by paying Essence \u2014 every two Essence spent increases the \u201cweapon\u201d by +1L. The maximum weapon bonus is equal to the spirit\u2019s Rank.'<br /> <br /> We're discussing this in another thread and trying to decide if this power allows for the 'Defense vs Firearms' powers some people have. Some say that, because it doesn't say so, there is no way to avoid it beyond not being in range. But we're thinking because of 'the Blast wounds as a +0L firearm.' and how its damage bonus is called weapon bonus, it's treated similarly to a firearm.<br /> <br /> Also, if it is indefensible, what rating fetish do you think would be appropriate to use a Numina?</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bI'd treat it as a firearm in terms of applicable defences, since that's the clear inference of it wounding as a firearm. If it wasn't for that, then I'd say Blast should allow Defence to be applied as normal against it as if it were any other non-firearm attack.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>- Chris Allen, Aberrant Line Developer, Freelance Writer<br /> <br /> \u200bLike my work? Feel like helping me stay supplied with tea? Check out my <b><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/acrozatarim\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1757-acrozatarim","name":"Acrozatarim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-01T09:46:24-08:00","id":1041883,"title":"","content":"Hi Acrozatarim, just wanted to say I'm still enjoying this immensely, also that I still love the wiki, really inspiring for my lazy self <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5439-gullinbursti","name":"Gullinbursti","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5439_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"291"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-05T03:50:02-08:00","id":1043909,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gullinbursti</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/925413-w-tf-actual-play-the-eater-of-names?p=1041883#post1041883\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hi Acrozatarim, just wanted to s